 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of lattices used for fractal summation. Each lattice requires a constant number of value noise lookups. [G]
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(N)$ for storing the lattices. The warp calculation uses $O(1)$ additional memory. [G]
-- **Strengths:** Produces organic, isotropic patterns without directional artifacts. Seamless tiling is maintained. [S1, unofficial]
